{"4053380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunday School", "steam_appid": 4053380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunday School</strong> is a short psychological horror inspired by surreal titles like The Exit 8 an P.T.  Step into a distorted world born from children’s drawings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 30–60+ minutes of tense, immersive gameplay, you’ll descend through haunting visions that blur the line between innocence and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.poster.avif?t=1776106282\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.webm?t=1776106282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.mp4?t=1776106282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a child’s mind, where trauma takes the form of a looping <strong>Sunday School</strong> corridor, you must distinguish normal rooms from those tainted by disturbing anomalies. Only by choosing correctly you can break the loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose wrong exit from the room, and the cycle begins again.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the signs guiding your way, and descend through all eight floors to uncover the unsettling truth that waits below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.poster.avif?t=1776106282\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.webm?t=1776106282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.mp4?t=1776106282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE ENDINGS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story doesn't end with just one playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game to find all the anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each anomaly is a key that brings you closer to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the developer: </i>This is a free game made with love, if you’d like to support future development, take a look at my other titles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunday School</strong> is a short psychological horror inspired by surreal titles like The Exit 8 an P.T.  Step into a distorted world born from children’s drawings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 30–60+ minutes of tense, immersive gameplay, you’ll descend through haunting visions that blur the line between innocence and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.poster.avif?t=1776106282\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.webm?t=1776106282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\