u’d like to support future development, take a look at my other titles.</p>", "short_description": "You are trapped in a Sunday School, plagued by eerie childlike hallucinations. Observe your surroundings carefully to spot anomalies, and descend deeper only when you’re certain it’s safe.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/58339af0938799f7630100986fb613d0f101212c/header.jpg?t=1776106282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/e848c0567a547a0cc11d971dd6c948a3803ae0d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776106282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/e848c0567a547a0cc11d971dd6c948a3803ae0d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776106282", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Should work on low end pcs</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Artur Latkovsky"], "publishers": ["Artur Latkovsky"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "37", "description": "F